Hi there.. <br>
<br>
This is my first time trying to post here.. just found it this morning during one of those &quot;scheduled&quot; updates. <br>
Have any of you out there noticed, (or I'm just on crack) that us druids don't really get the same options as say, clerics &lt;only using them cause I know about em.. &gt; have all this no drop quest armor around lvl 30.. <br>
<br>
